  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Documentation</h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<p class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile pct_downloadContent\" style=\"text-align: center; gap: 40px; display: flex; justify-content: center;\"><!-- 3D Model --><a href=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/185eb3afbc3c4e06b1356c0a530aef44/Marble_Run_Components_Kit_-_MH003_Model.zip\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #333333; font-weight: 600; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 20px;\" target=\"_blank\"> <img alt=\"3D\" class=\"download_svg product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/34cfd495f6e74bb59595d83a7b486516/3d.svg\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <span>3D Model</span> </a></p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K4OCdHYOOop5aGxqeiFcWXYnnXe\"></div>\n<!-- 文案布局 -->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\"><!-- 第一条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\"></h3>\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\">Overview</h3>\nThe <strong>Marble Run Components Kit</strong> contains all the necessary hardware components for assembling a <strong>Marble Run</strong>. To complete the assembly for an entirely functional piece, users also need to download the model files and 3D print the remaining parts.</div>\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-page-id=\"OKsfdVZTpoQRnExo2lIcyoskncC\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K4OCdHYOOop5aGxqeiFcWXYnnXe\"></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K4OCdHYOOop5aGxqeiFcWXYnnXe\"></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K4OCdHYOOop5aGxqeiFcWXYnnXe\">To download the model files of <strong>Marble Run</strong> and obtain detailed information, please visit the <strong>Marble Run</strong> on <a href=\"https://makerworld.com/en/models/14265\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><strong><u>MakerWorld</u></strong></span></a>.</div>\n</div>\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse aspect-video max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/7cd83e99fc7a49b4b979d78b699b6fba/MarbleRun_7935c21b-4134-4b44-92ce-37017868af27.png\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> </div>\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\"></div>\n<br/><!-- 第三条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\">Installation</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<div class=\"embed-container\"><div class=\"VideoWrapper\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" frameborder=\"0\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed//8_Su9jdzgNA\"></iframe></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\"></div>\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\"></div>\n<!-- 第四条 -->\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\">In the Box</h3>\n<span><span>1. Motor * 1 (USB)</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">2. Marble * 10 (5 Colors)</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\"></div>\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\"> </div>\n<!-- 第五条 -->\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\">Notes</h3>\n1. Please power the device using a USB power supply with the specified voltage. Please ensure that the conveyor belt is pre-folded smoothly. After power is applied, confirm the operational status of the motor and take precautions to prevent motor blockage.</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">2. It is recommended to use indoors at room temperature.</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">3. <span style=\"color: #ff2a00;\"><strong>The product contains small parts. Please take precautions to prevent children from inhaling or swallowing them.</strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-stpc\"></div>\n<div class=\"pct_t-stpc\"></div>\n<div class=\"pct_t-stpc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\"></div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\"><!-- table布局 -->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Product Specifications</h2>\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\"><!-- 表头 -->\n<tbody><!-- 第一行 --><!-- 第二行 -->\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\"><strong>Voltage</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">DC 5V</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\"><b>Packaging Size</b></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">100*69*35 mm</td>\n</tr>\n<!-- 第三行 -->\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\">\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-page-id=\"OKsfdVZTpoQRnExo2lIcyoskncC\">\n<div class=\"old-record-id-WN9wdvxjroLLKUxZrwrcWzjZnhd\"><strong>Product Weight</strong></div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"lark-record-clipboard\" data-lark-record-data='{\"rootId\":\"OKsfdVZTpoQRnExo2lIcyoskncC\",\"text\":{\"initialAttributedTexts\":{\"text\":{\"0\":\"Button\"},\"attribs\":{\"0\":\"*0+6\"}},\"apool\":{\"numToAttrib\":{\"0\":[\"author\",\"7118919285765865474\"]},\"nextNum\":1}},\"type\":\"text\",\"referenceRecordMap\":{},\"extra\":{\"mention_page_title\":{},\"external_mention_url\":{}},\"isKeepQuoteContainer\":false,\"isFromCode\":false,\"selection\":[{\"id\":64,\"type\":\"text\",\"selection\":{\"start\":0,\"end\":6},\"recordId\":\"WN9wdvxjroLLKUxZrwrcWzjZnhd\"}],\"payloadMap\":{},\"isCut\":false}' data-lark-record-format=\"docx/text\"></span></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">63 g</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\"><b>Gross Weight</b></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">77 g</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p><button id=\"paste-helper-id\" style=\"width: 0px; height: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; border: 0px; display: none;\"></button><button id=\"paste-helper-id\" style=\"width: 0px; height: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; border: 0px; display: none;\"></button><button id=\"paste-helper-id\" style=\"width: 0px; height: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; border: 0px; display: none;\"></button><button id=\"paste-helper-id\" style=\"width: 0px; height: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; border: 0px; display: none;\"></button><button id=\"paste-helper-id\" style=\"width: 0px; height: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; border: 0px; display: none;\"></button><button id=\"paste-helper-id\" style=\"width: 0px; height: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; border: 0px; display: none;\"></button></p>\n</div>",
